            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.31,
            0.089,
            0.483,
            0.114
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 13.9"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.3,
            0.126,
            0.875,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Search the internet or library to find out what hazardous materials have to be dealt with while disposing of electronic items. How would these materials affect the environment?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.299,
            0.171,
            0.876,
            0.202
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find out how plastics are recycled. Does the recycling process have any impact on the environment?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.239,
            0.746,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q U E S T I O N S"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.285,
            0.613,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. What is ozone and how does it affect any ecosystem?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.308,
            0.744,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. How can you help in reducing the problem of waste disposal? Give any two methods.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.378,
            0.514,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What you have learnt"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.426,
            0.696,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The various components of an ecosystem are interdependent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.447,
            0.868,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "n "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The producers make the energy from sunlight available to the rest of the ecosystem.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.469,
            0.869,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There is a loss of energy as we go from one trophic level to the next, this limits the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "number of trophic levels in a food-chain.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.507,
            0.627,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Human activities have an impact on the environment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.528,
            0.87,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The use of chemicals like CFCs has endangered the ozone layer. Since the ozone "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "layer protects against the ultraviolet radiation from the Sun, this could damage the environment.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.584,
            0.757,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "n "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The waste we generate may be biodegradable or non-biodegradable.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.606,
            0.867,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "n "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The disposal of the waste we generate is causing serious environmental problems.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.142,
            0.662,
            0.589,
            0.693
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "E X E R C I S E S"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.706,
            0.731,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Which of the following groups contain only biodegradable items?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.728,
            0.441,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) Grass, flowers and leather",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.749,
            0.424,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Grass, wood and plastic",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.771,
            0.49,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) Fruit-peels, cake and lime-juice",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.792,
            0.406,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) Cake, wood and grass",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
